{"animath":"0.1","canvas":{"height":540,"width":960},"kind":"concept","level":"secondary","scenes":[{"caption":"Pascal's triangle: the coefficients of (a + b)^n","duration_ms":12000,"id":"s1","narration":"Each row of Pascal's triangle lists the coefficients of a binomial expansion: row n gives the coefficients of (a + b) to the power n. Every entry is the sum of the two entries above it.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"n3","kind":"latex","size":44,"tex":"(a + b)^3 = 1a^3 + 3a^2b + 3ab^2 + 1b^3","x":90,"y":80}},{"at_ms":900,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p0_0","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":480,"y":150}},{"at_ms":1300,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p1_0","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":448,"y":212}},{"at_ms":1600,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p1_1","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":512,"y":212}},{"at_ms":2000,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p2_0","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":416,"y":274}},{"at_ms":2200,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p2_2","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":544,"y":274}},{"at_ms":2400,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":448,"cy":226,"fill":"#d97706","id":"dotA","kind":"circle","r":10}},{"at_ms":2400,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":512,"cy":226,"fill":"#d97706","id":"dotB","kind":"circle","r":10}},{"at_ms":2700,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"dotA","to":{"cx":480,"cy":274}},{"at_ms":2700,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"dotB","to":{"cx":480,"cy":274}},{"at_ms":3500,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p2_1","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"2","x":480,"y":274}},{"at_ms":3500,"do":"hide","target":"dotA"},{"at_ms":3500,"do":"hide","target":"dotB"},{"at_ms":3900,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p3_0","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":384,"y":336}},{"at_ms":4100,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p3_3","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":576,"y":336}},{"at_ms":4300,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p3_1","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"3","x":448,"y":336}},{"at_ms":4500,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":480,"cy":288,"fill":"#d97706","id":"dotC","kind":"circle","r":10}},{"at_ms":4500,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":544,"cy":288,"fill":"#d97706","id":"dotD","kind":"circle","r":10}},{"at_ms":4800,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"dotC","to":{"cx":512,"cy":336}},{"at_ms":4800,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"dotD","to":{"cx":512,"cy":336}},{"at_ms":5600,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p3_2","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"3","x":512,"y":336}},{"at_ms":5600,"do":"hide","target":"dotC"},{"at_ms":5600,"do":"hide","target":"dotD"},{"at_ms":6000,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p4_0","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":352,"y":398}},{"at_ms":6200,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p4_4","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"1","x":608,"y":398}},{"at_ms":6400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p4_1","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"4","x":416,"y":398}},{"at_ms":6600,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p4_3","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"4","x":544,"y":398}},{"at_ms":6800,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":448,"cy":350,"fill":"#d97706","id":"dotE","kind":"circle","r":10}},{"at_ms":6800,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":512,"cy":350,"fill":"#d97706","id":"dotF","kind":"circle","r":10}},{"at_ms":7100,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"dotE","to":{"cx":480,"cy":398}},{"at_ms":7100,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"dotF","to":{"cx":480,"cy":398}},{"at_ms":7900,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"p4_2","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"6","x":480,"y":398}},{"at_ms":7900,"do":"hide","target":"dotE"},{"at_ms":7900,"do":"hide","target":"dotF"},{"at_ms":8500,"do":"caption","text":"Row n lists the coefficients of (a + b)^n"},{"at_ms":9000,"do":"emphasize","dur_ms":900,"target":"p4_2"}]},{"caption":"(a + b)^n, term by term","duration_ms":11000,"id":"s2","narration":"The binomial theorem gives every term at once: term r+1 is C(n,r) times a to the n minus r times b to the r. The coefficients rise and fall, and the powers of a drop as the powers of b climb.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"exp","kind":"latex","size":40,"tex":"(a + b)^3 = \\sum_{r=0}^{3} \\binom{3}{r} a^{3-r} b^r","x":90,"y":70}},{"at_ms":900,"do":"show","shape":{"cx":72,"cy":112,"fill":"#d97706","id":"ptr","kind":"circle","r":9}},{"at_ms":1100,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"ptr","to":{"cx":100,"cy":150}},{"at_ms":1800,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"t0","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"T_1 = \\binom{3}{0} a^3 = 1a^3","x":130,"y":150}},{"at_ms":2400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"t0n","kind":"text","size":24,"text":"coefficient 1, powers of a fall 3 → 0","x":425,"y":150}},{"at_ms":3000,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"ptr","to":{"cx":100,"cy":220}},{"at_ms":3800,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"t1","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"T_2 = \\binom{3}{1} a^2 b^1 = 3a^2b","x":130,"y":220}},{"at_ms":4400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"t1n","kind":"text","size":24,"text":"coefficient 3, powers of b rise","x":512,"y":220}},{"at_ms":5000,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"ptr","to":{"cx":100,"cy":290}},{"at_ms":5800,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"t2","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"T_3 = \\binom{3}{2} a^1 b^2 = 3ab^2","x":130,"y":290}},{"at_ms":6400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"t2n","kind":"text","size":24,"text":"coefficient 3","x":640,"y":290}},{"at_ms":7000,"do":"move","dur_ms":700,"target":"ptr","to":{"cx":100,"cy":360}},{"at_ms":7800,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"t3","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"T_4 = \\binom{3}{3} b^3 = 1b^3","x":130,"y":360}},{"at_ms":8400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"t3n","kind":"text","size":24,"text":"coefficient 1","x":640,"y":360}},{"at_ms":9200,"do":"hide","target":"ptr"},{"at_ms":9500,"do":"caption","text":"Coefficients rise 1, 3, 3, 1; powers of a fall as b's rise"}]},{"caption":"Worked: expanding (2x - 3)^4","duration_ms":11500,"id":"s3","narration":"Take (2x - 3) to the fourth: each term is C(4,r) times (2x) to the 4 minus r times (-3) to the r. Keep the brackets around negative 3 — its powers alternate sign.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"q","kind":"latex","size":38,"tex":"(2x - 3)^4 = \\sum_{r=0}^{4} \\binom{4}{r}(2x)^{4-r}(-3)^r","x":70,"y":70}},{"at_ms":1000,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"w1","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"C(4,0)(2x)^4(-3)^0","x":60,"y":150}},{"at_ms":1400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"w1v","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"= 16x^4","x":830,"y":150}},{"at_ms":1700,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"w1v","to":{"x":560,"y":150}},{"at_ms":2500,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"w2","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"C(4,1)(2x)^3(-3)^1","x":60,"y":220}},{"at_ms":2900,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"w2v","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"= -96x^3","x":830,"y":220}},{"at_ms":3200,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"w2v","to":{"x":560,"y":220}},{"at_ms":4000,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"w3","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"C(4,2)(2x)^2(-3)^2","x":60,"y":290}},{"at_ms":4400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"w3v","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"= 216x^2","x":830,"y":290}},{"at_ms":4700,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"w3v","to":{"x":560,"y":290}},{"at_ms":5500,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"w4","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"C(4,3)(2x)^1(-3)^3","x":60,"y":360}},{"at_ms":5900,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"w4v","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"= -216x","x":830,"y":360}},{"at_ms":6200,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"w4v","to":{"x":560,"y":360}},{"at_ms":7000,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"w5","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"C(4,4)(2x)^0(-3)^4","x":60,"y":430}},{"at_ms":7400,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"w5v","kind":"latex","size":36,"tex":"= 81","x":830,"y":430}},{"at_ms":7700,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"w5v","to":{"x":560,"y":430}},{"at_ms":8500,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"ans","kind":"latex","size":34,"tex":"(2x - 3)^4 = 16x^4 - 96x^3 + 216x^2 - 216x + 81","x":60,"y":480}},{"at_ms":9400,"do":"caption","text":"Parenthesise -3 before raising it to a power"}]},{"caption":"Misconception: the power does not distribute","duration_ms":8500,"id":"s4","narration":"(a + b) squared is not a squared plus b squared: (1+2)^2 is 9, but 1^2+2^2 is only 5. The missing middle term 2ab is the whole trap.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"wrong","kind":"latex","size":48,"tex":"(a + b)^n \\neq a^n + b^n","x":140,"y":120}},{"at_ms":1300,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"trap","kind":"text","size":28,"text":"The classic trap: distributing the power over the sum.","x":140,"y":220}},{"at_ms":2700,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1a1a1a","id":"eg","kind":"latex","size":44,"tex":"(1 + 2)^2 = 3^2 = 9","x":140,"y":320}},{"at_ms":4000,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#b00020","id":"bad","kind":"latex","size":44,"tex":"\\text{but } 1^2 + 2^2 = 1 + 4 = 5","x":760,"y":420}},{"at_ms":4500,"do":"move","dur_ms":800,"target":"bad","to":{"x":140,"y":420}},{"at_ms":5600,"do":"emphasize","dur_ms":900,"target":"bad"},{"at_ms":6800,"do":"show","shape":{"color":"#1f7a3a","id":"fix","kind":"latex","size":40,"tex":"9 \\neq 5 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; (a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2","x":760,"y":480}},{"at_ms":7300,"do":"move","dur_ms":800,"target":"fix","to":{"x":140,"y":480}},{"at_ms":8300,"do":"caption","text":"The middle term 2ab is the one everyone forgets"}]}],"subject":"math","title":"A-Math binomial: Pascal's triangle and the (a+b)^n expansion","topic":"a-binomial"}